<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" ttp:timeBase="media" ttp:cellResolution="32 15"><head><metadata><ttm:title>BLOCK - RR</ttm:title><ttm:agent type="group" xml:id="v1">Native James, Professor Green, Double S</ttm:agent><ttm:item type="album">BLOCK (RR)</ttm:item><ttm:item type="spotify_id">7CveLkoaEo4iCwYT0NdZlC</ttm:item></metadata><styling><style xml:id="s1" tts:color="#FFFFFF" tts:fontSize="100%" tts:textAlign="center" tts:fontFamily="sansSerif" tts:fontStyle="normal" tts:fontWeight="bold" /><style xml:id="bg_vocal" tts:color="#A0A0A0" tts:fontStyle="italic" /></styling><layout><region xml:id="r1" tts:origin="10% 10%" tts:extent="80% 80%" tts:displayAlign="center" /></layout></head><body><div><p ttm:agent="v1">3 Contributors</p><p ttm:agent="v1">What Block Lyrics</p><p ttm:agent="v1">[Intro: Roadrunner GlockBoyz Tez]</p><p ttm:agent="v1">GlockBoyz</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Come on</p><p ttm:agent="v1">[Chorus: Roadrunner GlockBoyz Tez]</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Cap, boy, what block y'all be on? (Where?)</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Niggas only try to pull up on the block when we gone</p><p ttm:agent="v1">On FaceTime with the opps, wish I could pop 'em through the phone</p><p ttm:agent="v1">That ain't his real drop, he posted that shit when he got home</p><p ttm:agent="v1">[Verse 1: Roadrunner GlockBoyz Tez]</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Every time we got in beef, I never back down (I'm certified)</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Niggas tryna wrestle with me, this ain't Smackdown (I got somethin' for you, though)</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Real shit, you'll get fapped down</p><p ttm:agent="v1">He was chasing clout, now you got him on your background (He a wallpaper)</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Y'all believe anything, these niggas big cap (Thеse niggas big cap)</p><p ttm:agent="v1">My fans fuck with me, they say I ain't miss yеt (Okay)</p><p ttm:agent="v1">He died last year, come and get your lick back</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Put a hole in him, I hope one of y'all niggas know how to fix flats</p><p ttm:agent="v1">In that fast thang, treat my real whip like a stolie (Yeah)</p><p ttm:agent="v1">They had the drop, we was outside posted up like a goalie (Yeah)</p><p ttm:agent="v1">You ain't ready for this shit, Baby Boy, Jody (At all)</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Nigga said he on my ass, shut up, show me</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Say that money, it'll save you (It'll save you)</p><p ttm:agent="v1">She'll come over your crib and set you up like some cable (Like AT&amp;T)</p><p ttm:agent="v1">You wouldn't slide if a park paid you</p><p ttm:agent="v1">It's all fun and games, bet that shit ain't gon' be funny when I blaze you (Boy)</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Ain't no virgin in the gang, everybody popped somethin'</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Cappin' out behind tint with rifles when we opp huntin' (Get it?)</p><p ttm:agent="v1">392 the decoy, let the Scat get in the front</p><p ttm:agent="v1">I heard your homeboy died in the hood, he need a jump, nigga[Verse 2: GlockBoyz TeeJaee]</p><p ttm:agent="v1">I heard your homeboy died, man, y'all was tryna wake him up, nigga</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Man, like football in the streets, we just touch niggas</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Nigga, like basketball, we take him out the game, we sub niggas</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Now he a track star, he runnin' after I shot the gun, nigga</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Man, what block niggas on?</p><p ttm:agent="v1">They think I'm scared and out of town, they don't know that I'm at home</p><p ttm:agent="v1">On FaceTime with the opps tryna get the drop through the phone</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Feeling like Nuk, you gotta know that brrah my favorite song, nigga</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Man, fast thangs with no plates my favorite cars</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Better stop while you ahead if you was smart</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Man, turn your Scat Pack to a Dart</p><p ttm:agent="v1">In LA chillin' with the Sparks</p><p ttm:agent="v1">See, you don't get it, but with the AR</p><p ttm:agent="v1">It's like tearing a car apart</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Nigga, rock, paper, scissors, Glock, that's my new shit</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Man, my old ho keep callin', I'm on the block with my new bitch</p><p ttm:agent="v1">I'm makin' illegal turns, the strap on me, I'm really stupid</p><p ttm:agent="v1">I don't pay for new sauce, my uncle hit me with his whole wrist</p><p ttm:agent="v1">[Chorus: Roadrunner GlockBoyz Tez]</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Cap, boy, what block y'all be on? (Where?)</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Niggas only try to pull up on the block when we gone</p><p ttm:agent="v1">On FaceTime with the opps, wish I could pop 'em through the phone</p><p ttm:agent="v1">That ain't his real drop, he posted that shit when he got home</p></div></body></tt>